ometres per hour across the seas south of Japan.","fireDangerWarning":"","forecastPeriod":"Weather forecast for today","forecastDesc":"Mainly fine and dry. Cooler in the morning. The maximum temperature will be around 26 degrees during the day. Temperatures will fall further to a minimum of about 19 degrees in the urban areas at night, and a couple of degrees lower in the New Territories. Fresh northerly winds, strong offshore, up to gale force on high ground.","outlook":"The minimum temperature tomorrow morning will be about 16 degrees in the urban areas, and a couple of degrees lower in the New Territories. It will still be rather cool in the New Territories on Wednesday morning. The temperature difference between day and night will be rather large. Temperatures will rise progressively in the latter part of this week.","updateTime":"2026-11-09T08:45:00+08:00"},"dailyForecast":{"generalSituation":"Under the influence of the intense northeast monsoon associated with a cold front, it will be windy and temperatures will fall appreciably over Guangdong today. The weather will be generally fine and very dry over the region in the next couple of days. It will be cool in the morning. The temperature difference between day and night will be rather large. The monsoon is expected to moderate in the latter part of this week, temperatures will rise over the region. Upper-air disturbances will bring showers to southern China towards the weekend. Besides, Tropical Cyclone Cempaka will move across the seas south of Japan in the next couple of days.","weatherForecast":[{"forecastDate":"20261109","week":"Monday","forecastWind":"North force 5, force 6 offshore, up to force 8 on high ground.","forecastWeather":"Mainly fine and dry. Cooler in the morning. Temperatures will fall further at night.","forecastMaxtemp":{"value":26,"unit":"C"},"forecastMintemp":{"value":19,"unit":"C"},"forecastMaxrh":{"value":80,"unit":"percent"},"forecastMinrh":{"value":45,"unit":"percent"},"ForecastIcon":